      "description": "Native keyboard-accessible details/summary with a CSS plus/minus.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-faq\"><summary>Is OHMI made by Autodesk?<span class=\"ds-disclosure\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>OHMI is an independent student project. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Autodesk. Tinkercad is a separate product.</p></details>",
